<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's inflation 1.99 pct in August.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's inflation 1.99 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's consumer price index rose 1.99 percent in August, compared with increases of 1.7 percent in July and 1.1 percent in August 1995, the National Statistics and Census Institute said on Friday.</p>
<p>Annualized inflation reached 25.14 percent, and cumulative inflation for the first eight months of 1996 was 16.6 percent.</p>
<p>The government has forecast annual inflation of 23 to 24 percent for end-1996.</p>
<p>-- Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom (5932) 258433</p>
